WEBVTT

NOTE Unofficial English translation of the Thai narration. If it differs from the Thai original documents, the Thai original prevails.

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.573
The Senate Committee on
Agriculture and Cooperatives

00:00:05.573 --> 00:00:09.959
held Meeting No. 34/2569
on Monday, 5 October 2026.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.960
Mr. Sountorn Chaokijka, the committee
chair, presided over the meeting.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.640
First, the meeting considered progress
reports from its subcommittees.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.000
The committee's three current
subcommittees are chaired as follows.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.640
Livestock and Fisheries:
Mr. Ruchu Kaewlai.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:34.900
Water Management in Farm Areas Outside
Irrigation Zones: Miss Amorn Sribunnak.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:39.320
And Integrated Agricultural
Networks: Mr. Choocheep Auekarn.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:44.986
The Integrated Agricultural Networks
subcommittee considered ways to

00:00:44.986 --> 00:00:49.309
develop Thai agriculture into a
fully integrated agro-industry.

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:52.904
This means moving from producing first
and then looking for markets, to

00:00:52.904 --> 00:00:56.319
letting the market lead production,
to reduce the risk of oversupply.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.412
And letting farmers take
part in the value chain,

00:00:59.412 --> 00:01:02.179
so they receive a fair
share of the benefits.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:06.510
The state has an important role
in supporting infrastructure

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:10.264
and production inputs, such
as water systems, energy,

00:01:10.264 --> 00:01:14.159
machinery, technology and
funding through cooperatives.

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.744
It was also proposed to use
a central database linking

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:20.859
production, warehouse
stock and purchase orders.

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:26.220
The Water Management subcommittee
reported that, because

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:29.724
of the floods in Bangkok
and its vicinity, it

00:01:29.724 --> 00:01:33.539
cancelled its meeting on
Wednesday, 30 September.

00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:37.277
It set its next meeting for
Wednesday, 7 October, to

00:01:37.277 --> 00:01:40.864
consider chapters 1 to 5
of its draft study report.

00:01:40.945 --> 00:01:45.724
The subcommittee planned a
study visit to Chai Nat,

00:01:45.724 --> 00:01:50.222
Sing Buri and Suphan Buri
from 29 to 30 October.

00:01:50.303 --> 00:01:54.560
To gather first-hand information
from the field for its report.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:02:00.872
The Livestock and Fisheries
subcommittee reported progress on its

00:02:00.872 --> 00:02:05.858
draft study report on managing
stray animals and animal care.

00:02:05.939 --> 00:02:08.080
It planned two study visits.

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:12.142
The first, to the Bangkok
animal control centre at Prawet

00:02:12.142 --> 00:02:15.565
on Wednesday, 7 October,
together with delivering

00:02:15.565 --> 00:02:18.778
donated animal feed for
pets of flood victims.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:23.068
The second, to a dog shelter
in Thap Than District,

00:02:23.068 --> 00:02:26.038
Uthai Thani, from 12 to 13 November.

00:02:27.039 --> 00:02:32.138
The meeting considered the observations
appended to the committee's

00:02:32.138 --> 00:02:35.638
study report on food
security and food safety.

00:02:35.719 --> 00:02:41.499
At its sitting on Monday, 21 September,
the Senate raised further observations.

00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:44.749
The food security study
subcommittee therefore added

00:02:44.749 --> 00:02:47.858
these to the observations
at the end of the report.

00:02:47.939 --> 00:02:51.668
The committee approved them
and agreed to send the added

00:02:51.668 --> 00:02:54.798
observations, with this
report, to the Cabinet.

00:02:55.799 --> 00:03:00.419
The meeting also considered a
complaint and suggestions from

00:03:00.419 --> 00:03:05.039
the Senate's meet-the-people
project for the lower South, in

00:03:05.039 --> 00:03:09.659
Narathiwat, on transport and
the management of farm produce.

00:03:09.739 --> 00:03:12.339
And it considered replies from agencies.

00:03:12.419 --> 00:03:16.062
The Land Development Department
explained its support for a soil and

00:03:16.062 --> 00:03:19.438
water conservation project in the
Khlong Thom watershed, Krabi.

00:03:19.519 --> 00:03:23.343
Rayong Province and the Pollution
Control Department reported

00:03:23.343 --> 00:03:26.352
on checks of water quality,
and of the source of

00:03:26.352 --> 00:03:29.737
contaminated water affecting
farmers' durian orchards.

00:03:30.739 --> 00:03:33.699
This summary is based on the
committee's press release.

00:03:33.779 --> 00:03:36.729
Meeting minutes and reports
are available through

00:03:36.729 --> 00:03:39.498
the channels of the
Secretariat of the Senate.

